WEBVTT

00:08.808 --> 00:16.850
As a white, crescent moon overlooks the town

00:16.850 --> 00:24.848
From within a pale, blue maze
devilish things begin to stir

00:32.365 --> 00:36.169
Boy, here in this sinful world

00:36.169 --> 00:39.172
Believing, dreaming

00:39.172 --> 00:43.009
We are searching

00:43.009 --> 00:48.140
For the place to which souls should aspire

00:49.949 --> 00:58.358
Ah, how much profound darkness
must we turn to light

00:58.358 --> 01:02.929
For the color of the world to change?

01:02.929 --> 01:05.598
Ah, surely someday

01:05.598 --> 01:13.873
Ah, how many profound riddles must we solve

01:13.873 --> 01:18.833
For the door to paradise to open?

01:20.380 --> 01:27.013
Let's begin our journey

02:05.291 --> 02:06.622
It's beautiful.

02:09.996 --> 02:15.628
The 21st Night
Heimdall, God of the Dawn

02:18.605 --> 02:20.306
So you're calling on me, huh?

02:20.306 --> 02:22.672
Things must really have gotten bad, Norn.

02:23.343 --> 02:28.181
I regret not having spoken with you in
so long, Lord Heimdall, god of tactics.

02:28.181 --> 02:30.683
Are you here alone?

02:30.683 --> 02:31.650
Yes.

02:33.119 --> 02:35.644
And? What do you want?

02:37.624 --> 02:40.388
It was not we who summoned you.

02:41.027 --> 02:43.325
Then who did?

02:43.963 --> 02:45.430
It was...

02:47.867 --> 02:50.836
Have you forgotten your task?

02:51.171 --> 02:52.798
Well, Heimdall?

02:53.673 --> 02:54.640
Odin!

02:56.075 --> 03:00.876
Let your eye be a reminder of your pain
and of your mission.

03:03.483 --> 03:04.848
Heimdall.

03:05.552 --> 03:06.917
I understand.

03:08.521 --> 03:10.648
I rely on you more than any other.

03:11.891 --> 03:13.688
And I have a gift for you.

03:38.084 --> 03:39.551
This is...

03:59.939 --> 04:01.236
Go ahead.

04:02.242 --> 04:04.744
Quite the downpour, isn't it, Master Loki?

04:04.744 --> 04:06.143
It sure is.

04:06.813 --> 04:11.250
I've never been so depressed, Yamino.

04:12.185 --> 04:13.447
Master Loki...

04:14.153 --> 04:17.987
I've got a bad feeling.
I think something is going to happen.

04:18.291 --> 04:19.425
Like what?

04:19.425 --> 04:20.858
Master Loki?

04:22.295 --> 04:24.631
Aww, jeez!

04:24.631 --> 04:26.929
We're soaked.

04:27.333 --> 04:30.131
My goodness, look at the two of you!

04:30.503 --> 04:33.529
Umbrellas are just useless out there.

04:34.073 --> 04:36.175
Look at this!

04:36.175 --> 04:39.412
I can't go home.
That lightning is too scary.

04:39.412 --> 04:42.210
Let us stay here out of the rain, okay?

04:44.550 --> 04:46.313
Oh, man!

04:46.586 --> 04:49.522
I can't go pushing my cart
around in rain like this!

04:49.522 --> 04:51.490
Narugami? You too?

04:51.691 --> 04:54.159
I'm gonna stay here until this rain stops.

04:56.129 --> 05:00.233
Hey, now that everyone's here, why don't
we play a game or something?

05:00.233 --> 05:01.701
That sounds like fun!

05:01.701 --> 05:03.726
Is that all right with you, Loki?

05:04.837 --> 05:06.304
Yeah, I guess so.

05:07.040 --> 05:10.109
If you all stay in those clothes,
you're sure to catch a cold.

05:10.109 --> 05:13.346
Come with me. I'll get you some towels.

05:13.346 --> 05:15.507
Thanks a bunch, Four-Eyes!

05:47.046 --> 05:48.181
Heimdall!

05:48.181 --> 05:51.384
Azuma's Kitchen has got
a special deal today!

05:51.384 --> 05:53.119
Here, look!

05:53.119 --> 05:55.588
They're stuffed with so much bean jam
it's coming out their mouths!

05:55.588 --> 05:56.422
Frey!

05:56.422 --> 05:58.856
What, would you have
preferred imagawayaki?

05:59.425 --> 06:01.518
Ouch! What are you doing?!

06:02.628 --> 06:04.823
Playtime's over.

06:05.131 --> 06:06.428
Heimdall?

06:12.739 --> 06:15.742
I'm going to settle things with Loki.

06:15.742 --> 06:16.743
See you.

06:16.743 --> 06:17.710
Heimdall!

06:30.123 --> 06:31.852
I did it!

06:32.158 --> 06:33.955
I win!

06:34.927 --> 06:36.952
Thanks, everyone!

06:37.964 --> 06:40.057
The rain stopped!

06:41.667 --> 06:44.795
But it was coming down so heavily
just a minute ago.

06:45.605 --> 06:47.607
I guess that's the end of our stay!

06:47.607 --> 06:49.208
Shall we get going, Reiya?

06:49.208 --> 06:50.505
Sure!

06:51.878 --> 06:53.780
Alrighty, time for me to get back to work!

06:53.780 --> 06:55.577
I'll make up for lost time in one fell swoop!

06:56.416 --> 06:59.283
I suppose I'll go do the shopping for dinner.

06:59.819 --> 07:02.344
I'll come with you, Yamino.

07:14.901 --> 07:16.095
Extra-Spicy
curry

07:26.112 --> 07:28.910
Yamino, don't you think this is strange?

07:30.416 --> 07:32.585
Why isn't there anyone here?

07:32.585 --> 07:34.754
There haven't even been any cars driving by.

07:34.754 --> 07:36.355
Now that you mention it...

07:36.355 --> 07:39.222
Plus, there aren't any signs that it rained.

07:40.760 --> 07:42.728
You're right. How weird.

07:43.763 --> 07:44.957
Master Loki...

07:45.164 --> 07:46.732
Something isn't right.

07:46.732 --> 07:48.199
Master Loki.

07:51.704 --> 07:53.672
Fujimi Shopping Arcade

07:56.042 --> 07:58.977
A La Carte
Croquettes
Stew
Tempura Tea
100 Yen
Each
Special Sale
Today

07:59.779 --> 08:02.582
Huh? Is today a holiday?

08:02.582 --> 08:04.709
Did everybody go somewhere?

08:05.384 --> 08:08.842
Hey! I can't get any business
with things like this!

08:09.088 --> 08:11.716
Hello? Is anyone there?

08:11.791 --> 08:13.759
Hello?

08:19.298 --> 08:21.732
Ramen

08:21.934 --> 08:24.232
Everyone's gone...

08:24.303 --> 08:27.173
Could this be like the Bermuda Triangle?

08:27.173 --> 08:29.909
Or maybe a mass alien abduction?!

08:29.909 --> 08:31.570
What a strange mystery!

08:31.844 --> 08:35.648
I don't care if they're aliens,
what I need right now is customers!

08:35.648 --> 08:37.582
Anyone want some curry?!

08:43.856 --> 08:45.824
What's going on?

08:47.226 --> 08:48.750
I don't know.

08:49.462 --> 08:51.157
But we mustn't stay here!

08:51.597 --> 08:52.732
Right.

08:52.732 --> 08:54.893
Let's go back to the mansion, everyone.

09:09.015 --> 09:10.915
What's going on here?

09:10.983 --> 09:13.315
No good. Let's try another route.

09:14.787 --> 09:18.587
That's strange. There shouldn't
be an intersection here!

09:22.995 --> 09:26.021
Which way will take us home?

09:27.733 --> 09:29.360
Loki...

09:29.735 --> 09:31.032
It's all right.

09:31.404 --> 09:32.803
Fujimi Shopping Arcade

09:34.407 --> 09:37.035
We're back where we started, aren't we?

09:37.577 --> 09:39.374
Huh? I can hear people talking!

09:40.112 --> 09:42.546
Digital
Prints

09:42.615 --> 09:45.584
Oh, jeez! There are people here, after all!

09:46.118 --> 09:47.415
Wait, Mayura!

09:54.360 --> 09:55.657
Mayura...

09:56.729 --> 09:58.196
Mayura!

09:58.364 --> 09:59.763
Mayura!

10:02.635 --> 10:04.603
Hey, Daidoji!

10:28.427 --> 10:30.930
I'm scared, Loki.

10:30.930 --> 10:33.057
I want to go home!

10:33.699 --> 10:36.102
It's no use! We couldn't find her anywhere!

10:36.102 --> 10:37.797
What's with this place?

10:38.337 --> 10:40.806
This town is an illusion.

10:40.806 --> 10:43.434
It doesn't exist. This world is a fake.

10:46.012 --> 10:48.514
The town's an illusion?

10:48.514 --> 10:51.608
How are we going to get
back to the real world?

10:52.284 --> 10:56.618
The only way is to find whoever
fabricated this world.

10:57.256 --> 10:59.724
And where the heck are they?

11:03.195 --> 11:04.184
Who's there?!

11:05.197 --> 11:06.323
Narukami!

11:07.800 --> 11:08.926
Master Loki!

11:10.202 --> 11:12.170
Reiya! Fenrir! Ecchan!

11:13.673 --> 11:14.640
Yamino!

11:33.626 --> 11:36.254
You're behind this, aren't you, Heimdall?

11:38.764 --> 11:40.732
I've been waiting for you, Loki.

11:41.934 --> 11:45.734
Today I am going to settle the
score once and for all!

12:05.458 --> 12:09.195
You created that whole town just to
separate me from the others?

12:09.195 --> 12:10.822
Must've been a lot of work.

12:11.397 --> 12:15.595
I didn't want anyone to interfere with us.

12:16.836 --> 12:18.133
Where are they?

12:18.471 --> 12:22.703
I'll return them safely once we've
finished our duel to the death.

12:24.877 --> 12:26.174
Let's go, Loki!

12:26.445 --> 12:27.469
That eye!

12:32.118 --> 12:35.417
What do you think of my power, Loki?

12:36.222 --> 12:38.224
This is...

12:38.224 --> 12:40.283
the power that you should've lost!

12:40.793 --> 12:44.889
Exactly. Now let my scorching eye
turn you to ash!

12:49.535 --> 12:52.003
When did he get such power?

12:52.438 --> 12:55.407
Why not figure it out with those
reasoning skills you're so proud of?

12:55.407 --> 12:58.570
If you can during the time
you have left, that is.

12:58.978 --> 13:00.707
Eye of frost and snow!

13:03.482 --> 13:05.780
Give me back my right eye, Loki.

13:06.919 --> 13:08.318
I don't have it.

13:08.521 --> 13:09.783
Don't lie to me!

13:10.356 --> 13:12.525
You're mistaken.

13:12.525 --> 13:15.153
I'm not the one who has your eye!

13:16.061 --> 13:18.359
As always, you have a way with
words, if nothing else.

13:18.764 --> 13:19.765
Heimdall!

13:19.765 --> 13:20.959
Eye of flashing light!

13:26.839 --> 13:28.466
What's the matter, Loki?

13:28.607 --> 13:30.802
Is that the best you can do?

13:35.080 --> 13:37.383
I am not like I was before.

13:37.383 --> 13:40.477
If you don't want to die,
give back my eye now!

13:41.086 --> 13:43.384
I told you I don't have it!

13:43.889 --> 13:45.857
You certainly are stubborn!

14:16.155 --> 14:19.955
Must I fight you no matter what?

14:20.593 --> 14:22.959
Either you die or I do.

14:23.495 --> 14:25.019
It's one or the other!

14:29.969 --> 14:32.571
You're feared as the god of tactics.

14:32.571 --> 14:35.540
It's unusual to see you relying on
brute strength for a fight.

14:36.008 --> 14:41.310
I will do whatever it takes to defeat you
and get back my eye!

14:41.714 --> 14:43.204
Eye of sound waves!

14:45.784 --> 14:48.048
Listen to me! The one who has your eye is...

14:48.287 --> 14:49.488
Silence!

14:49.488 --> 14:52.787
I have been entrusted with the
task of eliminating you!

14:53.759 --> 14:55.056
Heimdall...

14:55.427 --> 14:57.496
They rely upon me!

14:57.496 --> 15:00.799
I lost my right eye because of you.

15:00.799 --> 15:03.097
But now, I am trusted above
all the other gods!

15:04.136 --> 15:05.170
You're wrong!

15:05.170 --> 15:06.865
You're just being used!

15:07.206 --> 15:08.833
You're not going to fool me!

15:09.108 --> 15:10.075
Listen!

15:17.016 --> 15:19.184
Your eye, which controls all your powers,
was supposedly lost.

15:19.184 --> 15:21.311
But someone already gave it to you.

15:21.787 --> 15:23.914
Or rather, gave it back to you,

15:24.256 --> 15:26.053
and that person is...

15:26.725 --> 15:28.420
Loki!

16:01.794 --> 16:03.562
That's right.

16:03.562 --> 16:05.530
That is your eye.

16:06.098 --> 16:08.066
The eye you'd supposedly lost.

16:10.402 --> 16:13.769
Who gave it back to you? Who, Heimdall?

16:18.877 --> 16:22.506
Odin hasn't placed any trust in you.

16:24.149 --> 16:27.086
What you're saying is absurd.

16:27.086 --> 16:30.544
I don't believe you!

16:31.023 --> 16:32.047
Heimdall!

16:32.725 --> 16:35.285
I won't rely on anyone else.

16:35.728 --> 16:38.788
I'll defeat you using my own powers!

16:40.566 --> 16:42.368
That's the reason...

16:42.368 --> 16:47.067
That is the only reason I've come here!

16:52.978 --> 16:54.413
It's no use!

16:54.413 --> 16:58.873
Once my eye of immobility gazes upon you,
you're unable to move!

17:02.721 --> 17:05.918
This time there are no friends
to come to your rescue!

17:07.626 --> 17:08.752
You're...

17:09.228 --> 17:12.629
You are alone. All alone.

17:13.265 --> 17:16.325
Now die, miserable in the
depths of your solitude!

17:16.969 --> 17:18.937
And will that satisfy you?

17:19.638 --> 17:20.434
What?

17:20.973 --> 17:23.208
Right now...

17:23.208 --> 17:25.506
What is it that you're fighting for?

17:56.408 --> 18:01.869
I thought it was strange that you'd
have such a gentle gaze.

18:03.715 --> 18:06.552
Yes, you lost your right eye.

18:06.552 --> 18:11.512
But by coming to this world, haven't you
gained anything in its place?

18:12.424 --> 18:14.392
Shut up, Loki.

18:14.693 --> 18:16.661
You should know...

18:16.929 --> 18:17.896
Shut up!

18:18.430 --> 18:23.602
That right now you're about to throw
that precious thing away.

18:23.602 --> 18:25.104
Are you sure you want to do that?

18:25.104 --> 18:27.039
Shut up! Shut up!

18:27.039 --> 18:29.007
Shut up!

18:32.311 --> 18:33.778
Heimdall!

18:37.116 --> 18:39.584
What do you know about me?!

18:53.832 --> 18:54.856
Why...

18:57.136 --> 18:58.933
It's over.

18:59.838 --> 19:00.896
Heimdall.

19:12.050 --> 19:13.952
Not yet.

19:13.952 --> 19:14.919
Loki!

19:16.922 --> 19:17.889
Heimdall!

19:22.461 --> 19:23.894
I will defeat you!

19:28.700 --> 19:30.964
That is all I exist for!

19:32.738 --> 19:35.901
Don't! If you use it like that...

19:36.441 --> 19:38.177
I don't care!

19:38.177 --> 19:40.645
I have nothing left to lose anyway!

19:40.812 --> 19:42.414
Stop this, Heimdall!

19:42.414 --> 19:44.644
If you keep using it, you really will...

19:44.983 --> 19:49.352
If I can at least take you with me,
that's good enough!

19:51.790 --> 19:52.882
Heimdall!

20:17.683 --> 20:18.877
Heimdall!

20:45.177 --> 20:47.145
Heimdall!

20:49.982 --> 20:51.347
Loki...

21:14.406 --> 21:17.773
Heimdall!

21:32.691 --> 21:34.989
It's raining so hard.

21:36.361 --> 21:37.555
This is...

21:38.063 --> 21:39.963
The real world.

21:42.901 --> 21:44.368
Loki?

22:16.835 --> 22:28.804
A moonlit road pierces the dense fog

22:30.515 --> 22:42.260
Perplexedly, we all wander towards tomorrow

22:42.260 --> 22:49.368
We escape the darkness of a desolate town

22:49.368 --> 22:55.807
Which threatens to halt even the telling of myths

22:55.807 --> 23:05.317
Transcending the limitless skies,
we're on a journey

23:05.317 --> 23:09.654
Even if we're hurt

23:09.654 --> 23:21.666
We're sure we can still make it,
so we want to keep on praying

23:21.666 --> 23:23.395
Believe in Heaven

23:31.276 --> 23:32.544
Next Episode

23:32.544 --> 23:35.714
Next Episode
The key words for the next episode are
"stew," "fate" and "the spring of truth."

23:35.714 --> 23:37.716
Next Episode
Hey, what's the name of your staff, Loki?

23:37.716 --> 23:38.550
Next Episode
Laevateinn.

23:38.550 --> 23:39.584
Next Episode
Leave the train?

23:39.584 --> 23:40.919
Next Episode
You don't have to mishear these things
on purpose, you know.

23:40.919 --> 23:43.522
Next Episode
It's pretty cool. Do you cast some kind
of spell when you take it out?

23:43.522 --> 23:44.189
Next Episode
Uh-huh.

23:44.189 --> 23:45.524
Next Episode
What kind of spell? What kind?

23:45.524 --> 23:48.293
Next Episode
It's not something I say out loud,
more like something in my mind.

23:48.293 --> 23:49.694
Next Episode
In your mind, huh?

23:49.694 --> 23:54.900
Next Episode
Snap! Crackle! Bwooor, kazam!
Ba-bam! Kashing! Gabwooo...

23:54.900 --> 23:55.600
Next Episode
Mythical Detective Loki Ragnarok,

23:55.600 --> 23:56.301
Mythical Detective Loki Ragnarok,

23:56.301 --> 23:57.736
The 22nd Night
The Goddesses' Reality
"The Goddesses' Reality"

23:57.736 --> 23:59.137
The 22nd Night
The Goddesses' Reality
Sounds like another strange mystery!

23:59.137 --> 24:00.472
The 22nd Night
The Goddesses' Reality
Like you.

24:00.472 --> 24:01.063
The 22nd Night
The Goddesses' Reality
